## System Architecture

### High-Level Flow
```
1. User sends query via CLI/UI
2. Main Script receives input (zero logic)
3. Main Script passes to Agent Layer
4. Agent Layer:
   a. Uses LLM Service to analyze query and decide routing
   b. Stores LLM call to MongoDB
   c. Calls Orchestrator with routing decision
   d. Orchestrator executes tools (stores executions to MongoDB)
   e. Agent synthesizes final response using LLM
   f. Stores synthesis LLM call to MongoDB
5. Main Script yields response to user
```

### Component Diagram
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    MAIN SCRIPT                          │
│              (Dumb Entry Point)                         │
│  - Receives user input                                  │
│  - Passes to Agent Layer                                │
│  - Yields whatever Agent returns                        │
│  - ZERO logic, ZERO decisions                           │
└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                     │
                     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  AGENT LAYER                            │
│              (THE SMART COMPONENT)                      │
│  ALL intelligence and coordination                      │
│                                                         │
│  ┌─────────────┬──────────────┬─────────────┐           │
│  ▼             ▼              ▼             ▼           │
│ LLM         Storage      Orchestrator    Conversation   │
│ Service     (logs LLM)   (executes)      Management     │
│                                                         │
│  Makes ALL decisions:                                   │
│  - Which tools to call                                  │
│  - What parameters to use                               │
│  - Sequential vs parallel                               │
│  - Retry vs abort on errors                             │
│  - How to synthesize response                           │
└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
